# A paste while bracketed paste mode is reset: the text arrives as typed,
# with each line end, LF or CR LF, sent as CR, and each C0 control but HT,
# LF and CR, DEL and each C1 control becoming a space, as xterm filters a
# paste.
# spec: ctlseqs, Bracketed Paste Mode; xterm's paste filtering
# covers: input.paste-end-marker
size 20 2
paste "hello"
paste "one\ntwo\r\nthree\rfour"
paste "a\tb"
paste "bell\a esc\e del\x7f nul-free\x01\x1f"
paste "c1 \u{85} \u{9b}2J"
paste "caf\u{e9} \u{20ac}"
